WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:11.467
Well, she was all things
that a chimp mother should be.

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:14.934
She was protective but
not over protective.

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:16.033
She was affectionate.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.767
She was playful.

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:20.000
But being supportive.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.700
And that was the key.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.700
And of course, that's what my
mother was, she supported me.

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:36.433
And there's no question but
those close contacts with Flo

00:00:36.433 --> 00:00:41.333
and her family
were very important

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:43.100
to my own development.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:52.133
It was just so amazing to
have the sort of relationship.

